  "physical_vm_count": 1,
  "placement": "Existing south-edge Sandbox-created site MN-CSE and maintenance deployment. The rollout updated app images in place and retained the MN data volume and operations store.",
  "scope": [
    "Virtual facility and independently generated virtual shaft position. Original ETSI 011, 033 and 046 software and the ACME MN-CSE ran on the cloud VM.",
    "The workbench was a separate Kubernetes Deployment with a facility-specific technician AE and credential, a private TLS connection to the gateway, and an HTTP listener bound to its own Pod loopback. An IAP/SSH-authenticated test driver used its normal browser-session HTTP interface inside the Pod.",
    "A scheduled inspection in this capture is an automated exercise of the technician interface. Human usability, physical inspection and field airflow recovery require separate observation.",
    "The source sample came from the 046 query. TestNotification records only callback reachability. Both logical edges on this lab share one physical machine.",
    "The historical five orders use the current configured target because their original CINs predate target capture. The new order carries its target on the reviewed CIN."
  ],
